{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-25662","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-30999","text":"07 — Security and Secrets"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31000","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-31001","text":" Tenant isolation via RLS, encrypted secret storage via Supabase Vault, telemetry authentication, abuse prevention, supply chain validation, and audit logging requirements."}]}],"id":"blk-25663","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-25665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31002","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25666","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31003","text":"Tenant Isolation (RLS)"}]},{"id":"blk-25667","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31004","text":"Every table in the control plane database enforces Row-Level Security:"}]},{"id":"blk-25668","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"-- Example: agents table policy\nCREATE POLICY \"users can only access own agents\"\n  ON agents\n  FOR ALL\n  USING (auth.uid() = user_id)\n  WITH CHECK (auth.uid() = user_id);"},{"id":"blk-25669","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31005","text":"RLS Rules"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-25671","spans":[{"id":"spn-31006","text":"Table"}]},{"id":"blk-25672","spans":[{"id":"spn-31007","text":"Policy"}]}],"id":"blk-25670","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-25673","spans":[{"id":"spn-31008","marks":["code"],"text":"users"}]},{"id":"blk-25674","spans":[{"id":"spn-31009","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid() = id"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25675","spans":[{"id":"spn-31010","marks":["code"],"text":"agents"}]},{"id":"blk-25676","spans":[{"id":"spn-31011","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid() = user_id"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25677","spans":[{"id":"spn-31012","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"}]},{"id":"blk-25678","spans":[{"id":"spn-31013","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid() = user_id"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25679","spans":[{"id":"spn-31014","marks":["code"],"text":"metrics_events"}]},{"id":"blk-25680","spans":[{"id":"spn-31015","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid() = user_id"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25681","spans":[{"id":"spn-31016","marks":["code"],"text":"billing_usage"}]},{"id":"blk-25682","spans":[{"id":"spn-31017","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid() = user_id"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-25683","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31018","marks":["bold"],"text":"Hard rule:"},{"id":"spn-31019","text":" No table is accessible without an RLS policy. If a new table is added, an RLS policy must be created before any data is inserted."}]},{"id":"blk-25684","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31020","text":"Provider Namespace Isolation"}]},{"id":"blk-25685","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31021","text":"Runtime provider resources are namespaced per user:"}]},{"id":"blk-25686","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25688","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31022","text":"Cloudflare: Worker names include user ID prefix"}]}],"id":"blk-25687","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25690","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31023","text":"AgentCore: Runtime resources tagged with user ID"}]}],"id":"blk-25689","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-25691","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31024","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25692","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31025","text":"Secrets Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-25693","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31026","text":"Supabase Vault"}]},{"id":"blk-25694","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31027","text":"Secrets are stored in "},{"id":"spn-31028","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase Vault"},{"id":"spn-31029","text":" -- an encrypted key-value store built into Supabase. The primary database ("},{"id":"spn-31030","marks":["code"],"text":"agents"},{"id":"spn-31031","text":", "},{"id":"spn-31032","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-31033","text":", etc.) never contains plaintext secret values."}]},{"id":"blk-25695","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"User adds secret \"OPENAI_API_KEY\" via dashboard\n  -> Value encrypted and stored in Vault (vault.secrets)\n  -> agents.env_var_keys = [\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"] (key name only)"},{"id":"blk-25696","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31034","text":"Secret Lifecycle"}]},{"id":"blk-25697","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. User creates secret via UI -> stored in Vault\n2. Deploy triggers -> Edge Function reads from Vault\n3. Secret pushed to provider mechanism:\n   - Cloudflare: Workers Secrets API\n   - AgentCore: Environment variable injection / Secrets Manager\n4. Vault reference remains; plaintext never logged"},{"id":"blk-25698","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31035","text":"Secret Rotation"}]},{"id":"blk-25699","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31036","text":"1. User updates secret value in Vault via dashboard 2. User triggers a re-deploy to push the new value to the provider 3. Old provider secret is overwritten"}]},{"id":"blk-25700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31037","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-31038","text":" Never log secret values. Never include secrets in error messages, telemetry events, or API responses."}]},{"id":"blk-25701","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31039","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25702","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31040","text":"Telemetry Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-25703","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31041","text":"The telemetry ingestion endpoint rejects unauthenticated events. See "},{"id":"spn-31042","marks":["code"],"text":"05_TELEMETRY_AND_METRICS.md"},{"id":"spn-31043","text":" for HMAC and JWT details."}]},{"id":"blk-25704","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31044","text":"Key requirements:"}]},{"id":"blk-25705","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25707","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31045","text":"[ ] Per-deployment signing key generated at deploy time"}]}],"id":"blk-25706","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25709","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31046","text":"[ ] Signing key stored in Vault (not in the deployments table)"}]}],"id":"blk-25708","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25711","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31047","text":"[ ] Anti-replay: timestamp within 5-minute window"}]}],"id":"blk-25710","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25713","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31048","text":"[ ] Attribution verified against deployment records"}]}],"id":"blk-25712","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-25714","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31049","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25715","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31050","text":"Abuse Prevention"}]},{"id":"blk-25716","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31051","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-25718","spans":[{"id":"spn-31052","text":"Scope"}]},{"id":"blk-25719","spans":[{"id":"spn-31053","text":"Limit"}]}],"id":"blk-25717","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-25720","spans":[{"id":"spn-31054","text":"Per-user, all agents"}]},{"id":"blk-25721","spans":[{"id":"spn-31055","text":"N requests/second (configurable)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25722","spans":[{"id":"spn-31056","text":"Per-agent"}]},{"id":"blk-25723","spans":[{"id":"spn-31057","text":"M requests/second (configurable)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25724","spans":[{"id":"spn-31058","text":"Payload size"}]},{"id":"blk-25725","spans":[{"id":"spn-31059","text":"Max 1 MB request body"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-25726","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31060","text":"Input Validation"}]},{"id":"blk-25727","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25729","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31061","text":"Reject oversized payloads before parsing"}]}],"id":"blk-25728","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31062","text":"Validate JSON structure before processing"}]}],"id":"blk-25730","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25733","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31063","text":"Prevent prompt bombing (excessively long message arrays)"}]}],"id":"blk-25732","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-25734","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31064","text":"Account-Level"}]},{"id":"blk-25735","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31065","text":"Disable agent on repeated errors"}]}],"id":"blk-25736","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25739","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31066","text":"Flag accounts with anomalous usage patterns"}]}],"id":"blk-25738","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-25741","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31067","text":"Hard-stop on plan limits (see "},{"id":"spn-31068","marks":["code"],"text":"06_BILLING_AND_LIMITS.md"},{"id":"spn-31069","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-25740","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-25742","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31070","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25743","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31071","text":"Supply Chain Validation"}]},{"id":"blk-25744","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31072","text":"Uploaded bundles must pass validation before deployment:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-25746","spans":[{"id":"spn-31073","text":"Check"}]},{"id":"blk-25747","spans":[{"id":"spn-31074","text":"Rule"}]}],"id":"blk-25745","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-25748","spans":[{"id":"spn-31075","text":"Size limit"}]},{"id":"blk-25749","spans":[{"id":"spn-31076","text":"Max compressed size (e.g., 50 MB)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25750","spans":[{"id":"spn-31077","text":"File count"}]},{"id":"blk-25751","spans":[{"id":"spn-31078","text":"Max files (e.g., 10,000)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25752","spans":[{"id":"spn-31079","text":"Path traversal"}]},{"id":"blk-25753","spans":[{"id":"spn-31080","text":"Reject entries with "},{"id":"spn-31081","marks":["code"],"text":"../"},{"id":"spn-31082","text":" or absolute paths"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25754","spans":[{"id":"spn-31083","text":"Symlinks"}]},{"id":"blk-25755","spans":[{"id":"spn-31084","text":"Reject unsafe symlinks"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25756","spans":[{"id":"spn-31085","text":"Required files"}]},{"id":"blk-25757","spans":[{"id":"spn-31086","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"},{"id":"spn-31087","text":" + entrypoint must exist"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25758","spans":[{"id":"spn-31088","text":"Manifest validity"}]},{"id":"blk-25759","spans":[{"id":"spn-31089","text":"JSON parses, required fields present"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-25760","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31090","text":"Post-MVP: dependency scanning for known vulnerabilities."}]},{"id":"blk-25761","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31091","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-25762","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-31092","text":"Audit Log"}]},{"id":"blk-25763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-31093","text":"The platform SHOULD maintain an audit log for security-sensitive operations:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-25765","spans":[{"id":"spn-31094","text":"Event"}]},{"id":"blk-25766","spans":[{"id":"spn-31095","text":"Fields"}]}],"id":"blk-25764","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-25767","spans":[{"id":"spn-31096","text":"Agent created"}]},{"id":"blk-25768","spans":[{"id":"spn-31097","text":"user_id, agent_id, timestamp"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25769","spans":[{"id":"spn-31098","text":"Agent disabled"}]},{"id":"blk-25770","spans":[{"id":"spn-31099","text":"user_id, agent_id, timestamp"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25771","spans":[{"id":"spn-31100","text":"Deployment created"}]},{"id":"blk-25772","spans":[{"id":"spn-31101","text":"user_id, agent_id, deployment_id, timestamp"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25773","spans":[{"id":"spn-31102","text":"Secret created/rotated"}]},{"id":"blk-25774","spans":[{"id":"spn-31103","text":"user_id, secret_key (not value), timestamp"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25775","spans":[{"id":"spn-31104","text":"Tier changed"}]},{"id":"blk-25776","spans":[{"id":"spn-31105","text":"user_id, old_tier, new_tier, timestamp"}]}],[{"id":"blk-25777","spans":[{"id":"spn-31106","text":"Invocation r